WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.080
Wait! Don't throw me out!

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:08.320
I am not trash. I am your glow up.

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:11.680
It's me, your banana.

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:16.080
And yes, my peel can help your skin look smoother.

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:21.840
First, toss the peel in a little water and let it simmer.

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:24.720
We're making banana seskin tea.

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:26.320
Let it cool,

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:28.920
then mix in a little honey.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:33.480
Now it's a soft, sticky mask.

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.200
Brush it on like this.

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:38.200
Thin layer.

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:41.080
Don't paint it like a wall.

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:49.200
Give it 10 minutes. Let me do my cute little magic while you relax.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.880
Rinse it off gently. No scrubbing.

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:57.040
Be nice to your face. Wow,

00:00:57.140 --> 00:01:00.140
look at that glow. Next time,

00:01:00.141 --> 00:01:02.561
seal it in with a tiny bit of oil.

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:05.125
And send this to a friend who needs it.
